      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1783357602808,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Counter questions :\n\n\nWhy not queue:\n\nactually queeus meant to dump something and any workers can pick it up\nand perform following task and notify - slower tasks\nbut in pub-sub things goes immedietely \n\n\n\nWhat if we connects web socket server with each others via http\nserver:\n\n\nwe can but its ugly approach - lots of connections maintances\nbecome hectic \n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Counter questions :\n\n\nWhy not queue:\n\nactually queeus meant to dump something and any workers can pick it up\nand perform following task and notify - slower tasks\nbut in pub-sub things goes immedietely \n\n\n\nWhat if we connects web socket server with each others via http\nserver:\n\n\nwe can but its ugly approach - lots of connections maintances\nbecome hectic \n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
